  "id": "psychometric-test",
  "term": "psychometric test",
  "definition": "A psychometric test is a structured test designed to measure an underlying ability or trait from a person’s responses. In this context, such tests are built and evaluated using statistical methods, including norms and test quality criteria, to see how well scores fit the population being assessed.",
